WEBVTT

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:33.370
There is life force in learning

00:09:33.394 --> 00:09:35.862
and life force in choice.

00:09:37.005 --> 00:09:38.494
Now, let me be clear:

00:09:38.518 --> 00:09:42.382
this does not mean women and girls
are responsible for fixing everything.

00:09:42.406 --> 00:09:44.022
(Laughter)

00:09:44.046 --> 00:09:45.891
Though we probably will.

00:09:45.915 --> 00:09:47.281
(Laughter)

00:09:47.305 --> 00:09:51.617
(Applause)

00:09:52.363 --> 00:09:57.487
Equity for women in agriculture,
education and family planning:

00:09:57.511 --> 00:10:01.344
these are solutions within a system
of drawdown solutions.